# Removed the deprecated LevelDB journal, and the internal AsyncWriteProxy that was only used by it
ProblemFilters.exclude[Problem]("akka.persistence.journal.leveldb.*")
ProblemFilters.exclude[MissingClassProblem]("akka.persistence.journal.AsyncWriteProxy")
ProblemFilters.exclude[MissingClassProblem]("akka.persistence.journal.AsyncWriteProxy$")
ProblemFilters.exclude[MissingClassProblem]("akka.persistence.journal.AsyncWriteProxy$SetStore")
ProblemFilters.exclude[MissingClassProblem]("akka.persistence.journal.AsyncWriteProxy$SetStore$")
ProblemFilters.exclude[MissingClassProblem]("akka.persistence.journal.AsyncWriteProxy$InitTimeout$")
ProblemFilters.exclude[MissingClassProblem]("akka.persistence.journal.AsyncWriteTarget*")
ProblemFilters.exclude[MissingClassProblem]("akka.persistence.journal.ReplayMediator")

# Removed deprecated deleteObject without revision
ProblemFilters.exclude[DirectMissingMethodProblem]("akka.persistence.state.scaladsl.DurableStateUpdateStore.deleteObject")
ProblemFilters.exclude[DirectMissingMethodProblem]("akka.persistence.state.javadsl.DurableStateUpdateStore.deleteObject")
